 "what_this_is": "The complete grounded question-and-answer corpus derived from the 23 CANON-014 source candidates. It is a Canon COMPANION corpus: it sits outside the Audit Gate source snapshot, because what establishes whether a source is true is the source artifacts and the audit, not questions written about them.",
