  "state": "GROUNDED, UNGRADED, UNCALIBRATED",
  "what_that_means": "Every item traces to one source and carries a real locator and a support quotation. No human and no model has answered any item. No difficulty label has been checked against any observed answer, so `difficulty` is an authored judgement and must never be reported as an empirical property.",
