  "what_it_means": "The epistemic state of the SOURCE the item came from, not of the answer. A held source's answers are as source-faithful as an accepted source's; what differs is whether the source has passed the Audit Gate. Status never changes the wording of a source-derived answer.",
  "accepted": "the source is live Canon under canon/knowledge/current/",
  "hold": "the source is a durable candidate under canon/candidates/canon-014/"
 },
